{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dungeon Crawl: Assemble Your Trio and Conquer the Depths</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A command-based dungeon crawler where you build a team of three adventurers to challenge a randomly generated labyrinth. Each run offers a new layout, with unpredictable item spawns, equipment drops, and buffs to discover.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from three character types \u2014 <strong>Balanced</strong>, <strong>Explorer</strong>, or <strong>Combat Specialist</strong> \u2014 and select a weapon class: <strong>Swordsman</strong>, <strong>Archer</strong>, or <strong>Mage</strong>. Strengthen your party through <strong>item synthesis</strong>, <strong>skill acquisition</strong>, and <strong>leveling up</strong> as you descend ever deeper into the dungeon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle monsters, gather treasure, and defeat the final boss awaiting on the lowest floor to claim your place among the high scorers. Every decision counts in this roguelike adventure.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"\u30d0\u30e9\u30f3\u30b9\u578b\u5263\u58eb\u30bd\u30ed\u30af\u30ea\u30a2","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3618720/ea5b30b3a0aeef7b8220786923bae6220f1b2f3e.jpg"},{"name":"\u30d0\u30e9\u30f3\u30b9\u578b\u9b54\u6cd5\u4f7f\u3044\u30bd\u30ed\u30af\u30ea\u30a2","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3618720/ea5b30b3a0aeef7b8220786923bae6220f1b2f3e.jpg"},{"name":"\u30d0\u30e9\u30f3\u30b9\u578b\u5f13\u58eb\u30bd\u30ed\u30af\u30ea\u30a2","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3618720/ea5b30b3a0aeef7b8220786923bae6220f1b2f3e.jpg"},{"name":"\u63a2\u7d22\u578b\u5263\u58eb\u30bd\u30ed\u30af\u30ea\u30a2","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3618720/ea5b30b3a0aeef7b8220786923bae6220f1b2f3e.jpg"},{"name":"\u63a2\u7d22\u578b\u9b54\u6cd5\u4f7f\u3044\u30bd\u30ed\